# Intentionally tracked, intentionally empty.
#
# .claude/hooks/sync-cloud-skills.sh clones personal skills into this directory
# at the start of every cloud session. Claude Code only watches a top-level
# skills directory that existed when the session started, so this placeholder
# makes the directory part of the clone — without it, skills dropped in by the
# hook would need a restart to be discovered.
#
# Everything else in here is gitignored. See docs/operations/cloud-sessions.md.
